#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2016 expect=noViolation domain=AE
#note "Every populated AESOCCD is a System Organ Class code of the (dummy) MedDRA dictionary; the missing AESOCCD on row 3 does not fire. AESOCCD is Num per SDTMIG 3.4."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset AE
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESOC   type=Char
col AESOCCD type=Num
---
001 | Nervous system disorders   | 10029205
001 | Gastrointestinal disorders | 10017947
002 | Nervous system disorders   | .
